<section class="problem">

<div class="card">

<h3>

The Problem

</h3>

<p>

Ranking well on Google no longer guarantees a business gets found.
ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity and Gemini now answer the exact questions
buyers used to Google — directly, with no click required. Most sites
have no idea whether they're actually being cited in those answers,
or what's technically stopping them.

</p>

<ul>

<li>No visibility into AI citations</li>

<li>Manual, one-off testing at best</li>

<li>No technical crawler audit</li>

<li>No prioritized fix list</li>

</ul>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h3>

The Solution

</h3>

<p>

GeoAudit runs a real, live audit on demand. It checks whether AI
crawlers can actually reach a site, tests real citation behavior
across four engines with genuine web-search-grounded queries, and
turns the findings into a prioritized, AI-written fix list — all in
under 20 seconds, for any URL.

</p>

<ul>

<li>Live citation testing, 4 engines</li>

<li>Crawler access + schema audit</li>

<li>AI-generated recommendations</li>

<li>Every result stored for history</li>

</ul>

</div>

</section>
